title Vinyl: design QA walk at 480x320 (the approved NP-480x320 layout, owner 2026-11-13: the format line, the output button and the volume group in the info column, six transport keys) and 320x480 (the volume group in the bottom row), their real density
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 610
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot 01-now
expect esc
@480x320 expect text "Vinyl"
@320x480 expect notext "Vinyl"
expect text "60"
expect text "Evolve 65"
expect notext "Vol 60"
wait 300
shot 02-now-volume
# the group's "+" (an icon: no text to tap), measured on each size's shot
@480x320 tapxy 0.875 0.609
@320x480 tapxy 0.848 0.928
wait 300
shot 03-now-volume-up
expect text "65"
# the output button opens the Output page
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 400
expect text "Automatic"
key left
wait 300
key b
wait 400
shot 05-browser
expect text "MUSIC / PHOENIX"
key q
wait 400
shot 06-queue
expect text "Move down"
key left
wait 300
key o
wait 400
shot 07-output
expect text "Automatic"
key left
wait 300
expect text "MUSIC / PHOENIX"
key esc
expect quit
